                    "args": {
                        "filename": "hawaii-packing-list.docx",
                        "content": "Packing List for Hawaii Vacation\\n\\n**Essentials**\\n- Passport\\n- Plane ticket\\n- Travel documents (driver's license, health insurance card)\\n- Credit cards\\n- Debit card\\n- Cash (local currency)\\n\\n**Clothing**\\n- 3-4 shirts\\n- 2-3 pairs of shorts\\n- 1-2 swimsuits\\n- 1 light jacket\\n- Undergarments\\n- Socks\\n- Sandals\\n- Hiking shoes\\n\\n**Beach**\\n- Beach towel\\n- Sunscreen\\n- Sunglasses\\n- Beach bag\\n- Water bottle\\n- Snorkeling gear\\n- Beach umbrella\\n- Beach chairs\\n- Water shoes\\n\\n**Electronics**\\n- Smartphone\\n- Laptop\\n- Power bank\\n- Portable charger\\n- Camera\\n- Phone case\\n- Headphones\\n\\n**Medications**\\n- Prescription medications\\n- Pain relievers\\n- Antihistamines\\n- Insect repellent\\n\\n**Miscellaneous**\\n- Reusable bag\\n- Travel adapter\\n- Earplugs\\n- Eye mask\\n- Travel pillow\\n- Snacks\\n- Reading material\\n\\n**Hawaii Specific**\\n- Insect repellent\\n- Sunscreen with high SPF\\n- Light rain jacket\\n- Water shoes\\n\\n**Notes**\\n- Check weather forecast before departure\\n- Pack light\\n- Consider packing a small daypack for excursions\\n- Don't forget to leave some extra space in luggage for souvenirs\\n"
                    },
                    "id": "call_ffb97510cf384f9fb018c5fc",
                    "placeholder_args": null
                }
            ]
